    {"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":550001,"isDeleted":false,"id":"d-yaml","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"x":945,"y":370,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":250,"height":280,"seed":5500,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1715472000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"text":"CI feedback loop:\n\nWeekly CV (Sun 02:00 UTC)\n  → cross-validation per plan\n  → opens issue on CRITICO\n\nDecay scan (Sun 02:00 UTC)\n  → expired claims report\n  → opens issue\n\nNightly spotcheck\n  → 1 random dim\n  → 1 persona\n  → alert if Δ>0.3\n\nPR gate (every PR)\n  → STATUS.md touched?\n  → evidence file updated?\n  → blocks merge if NO","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","baseline":9,"containerId":null,"originalText":"CI feedback loop:\n\nWeekly CV (Sun 02:00 UTC)\n  → cross-validation per plan\n  → opens issue on CRITICO\n\nDecay scan (Sun 02:00 UTC)\n  → expired claims report\n  → opens issue\n\nNightly spotcheck\n  → 1 random dim\n  → 1 persona\n  → alert if Δ>0.3\n\nPR gate (every PR)\n  → STATUS.md touched?\n  → evidence file updated?\n  → blocks merge if NO"},

